# Rendered per deployment by service_env._render_spark. Carries object
# storage credentials, so it must never be committed. The reviewable
# shape lives in spark-defaults.conf.template next to it.
#
# The whole conf/ directory is generated: the compose file mounts the
# directory rather than the file, because a single-file bind mount pins
# the inode and the deploy's rsync replaces files rather than rewriting
# them.
conf/
